  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reg. co-op. HR-BiH-Mont.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Reg. samarbete HR-BiH-MN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xE4;mnar skapa en grund f&#xF6;r samarbete &#xF6;ver gr&#xE4;nserna i Dubrovnik-Trebinje-omr&#xE5;det. Man vill &#xE5;terskapa den sammanh&#xE5;llna region som en g&#xE5;ng fanns genom att skapa m&#xF6;jligheter f&#xF6;r kontakter och konkret samarbete. Nyckelsektorer &#xE4;r ekonomi, naturresurser, turism, medier och lokala myndigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at establishing a foundatino for trans-frontier c-operation in the Dubrovnik-Trebinje region. The aim is to recreate the region that once existed here by creating possibilities for contacts and a concrete co-operation. Key sectors are economy, natural resources, tourism, media and local government.</narrative>
  </description>
